# Pre-mutation backups of an Edge Function's index.ts, written by mutate.mjs /
# mutate-send-push.mjs and removed by their `restore`. Both runners restore from an
# EXIT trap, so one of these on disk means a run was hard-killed — recover with
# `node scripts/edge-probe/mutate*.mjs restore`, never by deleting it. Ignored so a
# lane's `git add -A` cannot commit one, which would ship a deliberately broken
# function.
*.premutation
